{"id": "EUVD-2026-82990", "enisaUuid": "6b26fc5a-b6f0-3f7e-8bbe-f1aa685aa5f5", "description": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S industrial managed switch V1 and V2 firmware versions before 1.2412b260707 and 2.2412b260519 contain a stack-based buffer overflow in the web server. Insufficient bounds checking on data copied into a stack buffer allows a remote authenticated attacker to cause a denial of service or potentially execute arbitrary code on the underlying operating system.", "datePublished": "2026-09-18T15:18:22", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-18T17:53:38", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://www.planet.com.tw/en/support/security-advisory/11", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/planet-igs-5225-8p2t4s-v1-v2-stack-based-buffer-overflow-via-web-server"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-81944", "GHSA-xx65-qr94-rrw9"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.71, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "53a550a2-213d-31de-a0d6-5ffde3187d88", "product": {"name": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S V1", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}, "product_version": "0 <1.2412b260707"}, {"id": "882808a0-c540-3e1c-be06-f26739d5f3b7", "product": {"name": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S V2", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}, "product_version": "0 <2.2412b260519"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "103e589e-6ad1-33c1-8d69-c48fcfa1d39f", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}], "isExploited": false}